See full behavior and usage in [Logging](logging.md).

## Safety Rules (Project)

- Never run `DROP DATABASE`, `TRUNCATE`, `docker system prune`, or `docker volume rm`.
- Prefer read-only SQL checks unless data modification is explicitly requested.
- Use project-provided Docker commands for app/database access.
- Keep generated logs, cache, and temporary files out of commits unless intentionally versioned.

